 tor Coppola paints a chilling portrait of the Sicilian clan's rise and nea
 r fall from power in America\, masterfully balancing the story between the
  Corleone's family life and the ugly crime business in which they are enga
 ged. Based on Mario Puxo's best-selling novel and featuring career-making 
