SUMMARY:TCB – The Toni Cade Bambara School of Organizing
LOCATION:ICA\, 25 Harbor Shore Dr\, Boston\, MA 02210
DESCRIPTION:The ICA\, in partnership with the Boston Ujima Project\, presen
 ts a special screening of TCB – The Toni Cade Bambara School of Organizi
 ng\, a biography of the influential writer\, filmmaker and cultural worker
 \, who with humor and deep insight\, inspired a generation of artists to d
 edicate themselves to community empowerment. The film is structured as a s
 eries of lessons on cultural organizing\, gleaned from Bambara’s life an
 d shared by her friends\, colleagues and students.\nhttps://www.icaboston.
 org/events/tcb-the-toni-cade-bambara-school-of-organizing/\nFrom Pushpin B
